@startuml
actor Customer
participant CheckoutClient
participant OrderServerEntry
participant OrderService
participant CartService
participant PromotionService
participant LibraryService
participant OrderRepository
participant Prisma
database PostgreSQL
Customer -> CheckoutClient : xác nhận checkout
CheckoutClient -> OrderServerEntry : checkout()
OrderServerEntry -> OrderService : createOrder(userId)
OrderService -> CartService : getCheckoutItems()
CartService --> OrderService : cart items
OrderService -> LibraryService : kiểm tra sở hữu
LibraryService --> OrderService : kết quả
OrderService -> PromotionService : tính giá hiện hành
PromotionService --> OrderService : giá áp dụng
OrderService -> OrderRepository : createOrderAndItems()
OrderRepository -> Prisma : transaction
Prisma -> PostgreSQL : INSERT Order + OrderItem
PostgreSQL --> Prisma : commit
Prisma --> OrderRepository : Order
OrderRepository --> OrderService : Order
OrderService --> CheckoutClient : Order chờ thanh toán
@enduml
